    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n95944" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπινθ-ήρ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῆρος</span>,
			ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>spark</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Pl.</u>
				1053
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Ph.</u>
				205a12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Cael.</u>
				276a4
			</span></i>; of a meteor, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦ δέ τε πολλοὶ ἀπὸ σπινθῆρες
					ἵενται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					4.77
				</span></i>
			: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐμβαλὼν ς. Μεγαρικοῦ ψηφίσματος
					ἐξεφύσησεν πόλεμον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					609
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκ τούτου τοῦ ς. ἐξεκαύθη πόλεμος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plb.
					18.39.2
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὀφθαλμοὺς σπινθῆρας ἔχεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					12.196
				</span></i>
			 (<i><span class="en">
				Strat.
			</span></i>), cf. <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Wi.</u>
				11.18
			</span></i>.</div>
